      "sample": 2,
      "response": "<!-- FAQ section built with real Baklava components (verified via MCP get_component / component_examples).\n     bl-accordion-group: multiple (boolean) - if false only one accordion open at a time.\n     bl-accordion: caption (string) shows the trigger label; default slot holds the answer; icon attr optional.\n     Event: bl-toggle (CustomEvent<boolean>) fires when open state changes. -->\n<bl-accordion-group class=\"faq-group\">\n  <h2 class=\"faq-title\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n\n  <bl-accordion caption=\"How do I reset my password?\">\n    <p>Go to the sign-in page and choose \"Forgot password\". We will email you a secure link to set a new password.</p>\n  </bl-accordion>\n\n  <bl-accordion caption=\"Which payment methods do you accept?\">\n    <p>We accept major credit and debit cards, as well as popular digital wallets. Apple Pay and Google Pay are supported at checkout.</p>\n  </bl-accordion>\n\n  <bl-accordion caption=\"How long does shipping take?\">\n    <p>Standard shipping usually arrives in 3–5 business days. Express shipping is available at checkout for delivery in 1–2 business days.</p>\n  </bl-accordion>\n\n  <bl-accordion caption=\"Can I cancel my order after placing it?\">\n    <p>Yes — you can cancel within 24 hours of placing your order from the order history page. Refunds are issued to the original payment method.</p>\n  </bl-accordion>\n</bl-accordion-group>\n\n<script type=\"module\">\n  // Real Baklava event: bl-toggle (CustomEvent<boolean>) — fires on open-state change.\n  const group = document.querySelector('.faq-group');\n  group?.addEventListener('bl-toggle', (e) => {\n    const caption = e.target?.getAttribute('caption') || 'item';\n    console.log(`[FAQ] \"${caption}\" ${e.detail ? 'expanded' : 'collapsed'}`);\n  });\n</script>\n",
